        <mxCell id="n51" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;The templates and the assurance level decision sheet are held on the NHSBSA SharePoint, alongside the rest of the analytical documentation, and opening them needs NHSBSA network access. If you cannot reach them, ask the Data Science, Advanced Analytics and Statistics team. Every card here is written out in the text description below the picture, and §12 lists every standard and internal document named in the playbook.&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=11;fontColor=#231F20;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
